markdown
# 🏭 AI Autonomous Manufacturing Planner

> **Plan smarter. Simulate first. Adapt instantly.** ⚡

An intelligent, AI-driven manufacturing planning system that autonomously schedules production, optimizes factory resources, simulates real-world scenarios using a digital twin, and adapts to supply chain disruptions in real time.

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-in%20development-yellow)
![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.10+-blue)
![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-0.115-green)
![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-18-61dafb)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-lightgrey)

---

## 🎯 What It Does

- **🧠 Autonomous Production Scheduling** — Uses Reinforcement Learning (DQN) to generate optimal production schedules without manual intervention.
- **⚙️ Factory Resource Optimization** — Balances machine utilization, worker allocation, and material consumption to maximize throughput.
- **🏭 Digital Twin Simulation** — Virtual replica of the factory floor built with SimPy to test "what-if" scenarios before real execution.
- **🚨 Disruption Adaptation** — Automatically re-plans when machines break down, materials arrive late, or orders change priority.
- **💡 AI Insights (Gemini)** — Natural language explanations and improvement suggestions powered by Google Gemini API.
- **📊 Interactive Dashboard** — Beautiful React UI with Gantt charts, KPIs, live simulation metrics, and bottleneck analysis.

---

## 🧠 Core Technologies

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| **AI / ML** | Reinforcement Learning (DQN), Genetic Algorithm, Job-Shop Scheduling |
| **Simulation** | Digital Twin (SimPy) |
| **Backend** | Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Pydantic |
| **Frontend** | React (Vite), TailwindCSS, Recharts |
| **Database** | SQLite |
| **AI API** | Google Gemini |
| **Visualization** | Matplotlib, Recharts |

---

